          "sourceName": "GS1 General Specifications",
          "sourceURL": "https://ref.gs1.org/standards/genspecs",
          "id": "interleaved_2_of_5_symbology"
        },
        {
          "term": "International Standard Book Number",
          "abbreviation": "ISBN",
          "definition": "A 13-digit number that identifies the title or other book-like product (such as an audiobook) to which it is assigned that is obtained from the official ISBN Agency in a country.",
